    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Protection from Evildoers"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "For the choir director. A psalm of David."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "God, hear my voice when I am in anguish.",
          "Protect my life from the terror of the enemy."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Hide me from the scheming of wicked people,",
          "from the mob of evildoers,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "who sharpen their tongues like swords",
          "and aim bitter words like arrows,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "shooting from concealed places at the blameless.",
          "They shoot at him suddenly and are not afraid."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They adopt an evil plan;",
          "they talk about hiding traps and say,",
          "“Who will see them? ” ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They devise crimes and say,",
          "“We have perfected a secret plan.”",
          "The inner man and the heart are mysterious."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But God will shoot them with arrows;",
          "suddenly, they will be wounded."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "They will be made to stumble;",
          "their own tongues work against them.",
          "All who see them will shake their heads."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then everyone will fear",
          "and will tell about God’s work,",
          "for they will understand what he has done."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The righteous one rejoices in the Lord",
          "and takes refuge in him;",
          "all those who are upright in heart",
          "will offer praise."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
